---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'July 30, 2026';
---

<PageLayout
	title="Terms — Epicenter"
	description="Epicenter is free, open-source, local-first software, built in the open and provided as-is."
	contained
>
	<div class="legal">
		<p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
		<h1 class="title-xl">Terms</h1>
		<p class="stamp-line">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>

		<div class="body read">
			<p>
				Epicenter is free and open source. Its applications and server are
				licensed under AGPL-3.0, while its embeddable toolkit packages use the
				MIT license. The code is on
				<a class="link" href="https://github.com/EpicenterHQ/epicenter"
					>GitHub</a
				>, and you are welcome to read it, run it, and change it under those
				licenses.
			</p>

			<p>
				It comes with no warranty. I build these tools with care, but I cannot
				promise they are perfect, so you run them at your own risk, and your
				data and your credentials are yours to look after.
			</p>

			<p>
				Some of these are experiments, and they might change or go away. That is
				part of the point of local-first: the working copy remains on your
				device. Its storage format depends on the tool and platform, and may
				include browser storage, databases, or exported files.
			</p>

			<p>
				If you connect a service like QuickBooks, you are also agreeing to that
				service's terms. Epicenter is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
				services it can connect to.
			</p>

			<p>
				Questions are welcome:
				<a class="link" href="mailto:hello@epicenter.so">hello@epicenter.so</a>,
				or open an issue on
				<a class="link" href="https://github.com/EpicenterHQ/epicenter"
					>GitHub</a
				>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
	.legal {
		max-width: 36rem;
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding-block: 3.25rem 0;
	}

	.legal .title-xl {
		margin-top: 0.85rem;
	}

	.stamp-line {
		margin-top: 0.9rem;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		color: var(--ink-faint);
	}

	.body {
		margin-top: 2.25rem;
	}

	.body p + p {
		margin-top: 1.1rem;
	}
</style>
